     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Forms of meN-",
     "texto": [
      "**Bantu → membantu** uses **mem-**; **tulis → menulis**, **men-**; **sapu → menyapu**, **meny-**. **Gambar → menggambar** keeps the **g** after **meng-**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Being able to do something",
     "texto": [
      "**Bisa** means \"can\" or \"to know how to\", and you already know it. **Bermain** is used with sports; **memainkan**, with instruments."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
